  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220ºC/200ºC fan-forced.\n• Chop cauliflower into small florets.\n• Thickly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667151d8de5ffd5651f64e31-448f7a29.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place cauliflower and carrot on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with Mumbai spice blend and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat. Roast until tender and brown around the edges, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667151d8de5ffd5651f64e31-f4c6de43.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until slightly softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add another drizzle of olive oil, Bengal curry paste (see ingredients) and garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667151d8de5ffd5651f64e31-1cf7af5f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add basmati rice and currants, stirring to coat.\n• Add the water and vegetable stock pot, then bring to the boil.\n• Cover and reduce heat to medium-low. Cook for 12 minutes, then remove pan from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 15 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667151d8de5ffd5651f64e31-af5aa606.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop roasted almonds. Roughly chop coriander.\n• When rice is done, stir through roasted veggies and almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667151d8de5ffd5651f64e31-0becaf2c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Divide roast cauliflower biryani between bowls. Top with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle with chilli and coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667151d8de5ffd5651f64e31-485cd2dc.jpeg"
    }
  ]
